    "created_at": "2025-03-03T16:52:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-03T16:52:23Z",
    "body": "I don't think there's anything that has changed since the previous discussions. The existing methods (including `trace` omitted above) are not semantic in so much as they are logging levels, with a unleveled \"log\" for backwards compatibility. Successes would likely be at the informational or lower level.",
